    {
      "uid": "zhcn:651a5ae639c979cfc97d2eb5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "レースを楽しむ心を捨てて、\r\nライバルとの関係を捨てて、\nアドマイヤベガはひたすら孤独を選ぶ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc9924a34149f6b434cd3cb7d4e5ece391aeb079682c61444b9172249c4063eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
